iv>It seems to say you need Spirit 4 to bind an unwilling spirit <u>or</u> Prime 4 to bind a willing spirit (not &quot;<u>and</u> prime 4&quot;)<br /> <br /> I'm assuming that this means you can bind a willing or unwilling spirit with Spirit 4 but happen to be also able to bind a willing spirit with Prime 4.<br /> As for chiminage, I always considered that to be just you talking to a spirit and the spirit doing the actual work of becoming part of a fetish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12480-spacecat","name":"Spacecat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12480_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"597"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T17:42:59-08:00","id":1056392,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Spacecat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1055893-fetish-information?p=1056117#post1056117\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It seems to say you need Spirit 4 to bind an unwilling spirit <u>or</u> Prime 4 to bind a willing spirit (not &amp;quot;<u>and</u> prime 4&amp;quot<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm assuming that this means you can bind a willing or unwilling spirit with Spirit 4 but happen to be also able to bind a willing spirit with Prime 4.<br /> As for chiminage, I always considered that to be just you talking to a spirit and the spirit doing the actual work of becoming part of a fetish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Prime 4 to bind a spirit? Doesn't make any sense.<br /> <br /> As for Chiminage... Yes. You can use just Spirit 2, and with a lot of diplomacy and favors exchange, convince the extradimensional being to enter the fetish.<br /> <br /> <u>If he is capable of doing so</u><br /> <br /> Most spirits however, don't have enough power to possess items... For those, you'll still need Spirit 4.<br /> <br /> Spirits able to do all the job alone will be more powerful and rare than most of the spirits the Mage will find routinely. That means it will be far more demanding (if he can do all by himself, why would he need the Mage for after all? You better throw it some sweet bone to convince such a spirit)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12880-karlgust","name":"Karlgust","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"614"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-28T18:07:54-08:00","id":1056396,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Karlgust</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1055893-fetish-information?p=1056392#post1056392\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for Chiminage... Yes. You can use just Spirit 2, and with a lot of diplomacy and favors exchange, convi